│   TESTER (subagent) → "Final test run" message              │
│   Runs in parallel:                                         │
│     a) Wait on CI (gh run watch) for the four PHP Quality   │
│        jobs: phpunit (8.2), phpunit (8.3), phpstan,         │
│        cs-fixer, security-audit                             │
│     b) Local Playwright E2E (3 specs) — until E2E migrates  │
│        to CI as a separate roadmap step                     │
│   On FAIL → delegate to Refactorer → Verifier → Tester      │
│   (full mini-loop), commit fix, push, re-run Final Test     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
    │
    ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ BUGBOT QUICK-PEEK (Orchestrator, non-blocking)              │
│   Single `gh api repos/.../pulls/$PR/reviews` call. Read    │
│   the latest review where author.login == "cursor".         │
│   Decision matrix:                                          │
│     • no review yet OR review on stale SHA  → proceed       │
│     • review on latest SHA, body matches                    │
│       /found [0-9]+ potential issue/         → mini-loop    │
│       (Refactorer → Verifier → Tester →                     │
│       push fix → re-run Final Test → re-peek)               │
│     • review on latest SHA without issue text → proceed     │
